WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.650
An old inn.

2
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:05.660
Two men in the same coat,
with the same small beer.

3
00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:07.230
They could be friends.

4
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:08.780
The table splits.

5
00:00:08.830 --> 00:00:13.760
Now they stand opposite each other,
in two lines of identical uniforms.

6
00:00:13.810 --> 00:00:16.860
Years later, one of them tries to explain:

7
00:00:16.910 --> 00:00:20.810
"I shot him dead because—"
And then the words run out.

8
00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:24.230
He reaches for a reason,
and keeps tripping over it.

9
00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:26.630
Why can't he say why?

10
00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:29.080
In this mission, you'll meet the speaker:

11
00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:32.210
an ordinary ex-soldier, talking in a pub.

12
00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:36.280
Hardy wrote it in 1902,
during the Second Boer War.

13
00:00:36.330 --> 00:00:38.840
You'll set the two men side by side.

14
00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:40.800
How different are they, really?

15
00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:44.060
And you'll track where his
explanation starts to wobble.

16
00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.660
Your mission: explain
why he can't say why.
